=== 8. which status changes leave a trace in quote_revisions (the quote history) or activities ===
      DRAFT->SENT      quote_revisions=0 activities=0
      DRAFT->ACCEPTED  quote_revisions=0 activities=0
      SENT->LOST       quote_revisions=0 activities=0
